an&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;   &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_f783c63122418086-456&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;3.)Warga memilih menu informasi yang ingin dilihat (Melihat Status Pembayaran Iuran, Melihat Rekapitulasi Kas RT, atau Melihat Laporan Keuangan)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;   &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif