        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nautonumber\ntitle Sequence Diagram - Transparansi Keuangan Warga\n\nactor \&quot;Warga / Anggota RT\&quot; as Warga\nboundary \&quot;:DashboardWargaUI\&quot; as UI\ncontrol \&quot;:LaporanController\&quot; as Ctrl\nentity \&quot;:Transaksi\&quot; as TransaksiModel\n\nWarga -&gt; UI : bukaDashboardWarga()\nUI -&gt; Ctrl : getSummaryKas()\nCtrl -&gt; TransaksiModel : querySummaryKas()\nTransaksiModel --&gt; Ctrl : dataSummary\nCtrl --&gt; UI : tampilkanSummary(dataSummary)\n\nalt Melihat Status Pembayaran Iuran\n    Warga -&gt; UI : pilihStatusIuranPribadi()\n    UI -&gt; Ctrl : getStatusIuranWarga(idWarga)\n    Ctrl -&gt; TransaksiModel : queryIuranByWarga(idWarga)\n    TransaksiModel --&gt; Ctrl : dataIuran\n    Ctrl --&gt; UI : tampilkanStatusIuran(dataIuran)\nelse Melihat Rekapitulasi &amp; Laporan Keuangan\n    Warga -&gt; UI : pilihLaporanKeuangan()\n    UI -&gt; Ctrl : getLaporanKeuangan()\n    Ctrl -&gt; TransaksiModel : queryAllKasAndExpenses()\n    TransaksiModel --&gt; Ctrl : dataLaporan\n    Ctrl --&gt; UI : tampilkanLaporanDanRekap(dataLaporan)\nend\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="pfmKx95eAKbNcBHFcjHj-1">
